   "kind": "signal",
   "type": "UriSpeechStarted",
   "text": "Buddhist Culture: The city is a hub for Buddhist culture, featuring numerous monasteries (gompas) such as Tsuglagang, Enchey Monastery, and Rumtek Monastery (located nearby in Rumtek)."
  },
